n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}^{2}}{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{({sin}^{2}⁡\\theta +{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta )+1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1+1-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )}{(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }+\\frac{1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta .\n$$" 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263099 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263100 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263101 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263102 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1000 #edb/ref 17592186263103 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1041 "selection" 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1104 #edb/ref 17592186263099 13194139533881 true] [17592186263098 1110 #uuid "63e0b72a-0e78-55e0-af58-b1d477fc563e" 13194139533881 true] [17592186263099 1034 "2\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta " 13194139533881 true] [17592186263099 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533881 true] [17592186263099 1111 #uuid "3b9b9d60-2107-5f0b-9fc0-f9947951ca9c" 13194139533881 true] [17592186263100 1034 "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta "